# Copy to ~/.config/tuimon/hosts. One ssh target per line; # starts a comment.
# A target is anything ssh accepts: a Host alias from your ssh config, a host
# name, or user@host. Each must already work with `ssh -o BatchMode=yes <target> true`
# (key-based login, host key accepted). Nothing is installed on these machines.
#
# build-box
